    "created_at": "2016-10-18T18:30:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-18T18:30:20Z",
    "body": "As the author of the original bug cited in #1087, I am thrilled to see progress on this! Personally, the behavior described above is exactly what I hoped to eventually see formalized and I think it will finally give datalist the opportunity to be useful to developers! I hope the browser collaborators mentioned here will agree that some standardization on this matter will help a lot! Just my two cents.\n",
