    "updated_at": "2016-10-27T02:07:56Z",
    "body": "Thanks @domenic for doing this, I think it's generally a good idea to have a guidance in the spec suggesting what user agents should do. If most browsers agree on this, I think we would definitely be interested in follow it, though I am not sure the schedule for it.\n",
